<section id="engineering" aria-labelledby="engineering-title" class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-14 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="lg:col-span-6"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface aspect-[4/5] rounded-[32px] sm:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-[4/5]"><div data-parallax="6" class="absolute -inset-y-[12%] inset-x-0"><img alt="Side profile of the PACE titanium core flowing into the woven strap" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-core.jpg"/></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 lg:pt-10"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">05</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Materials</p><h2 id="engineering-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Engineered</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">to</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">disappear.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">Everything that touches your skin was designed to be forgotten. Everything inside was designed to never miss a beat.</div></div><ol class="mt-14 border-t border-line"><li data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-[48px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-7"><span class="eyebrow pt-1 text-signal-deep">01</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Grade 5 titanium core</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Machined from a single billet and bead-blasted to a satin finish. 11 grams, 8.6 mm thin, with no seams to catch on a sleeve.</p></div></li><li data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-[48px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-7"><span class="eyebrow pt-1 text-signal-deep">02</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Double-weave strap</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Recycled nylon over an elastane core. Breathable, quick-drying and soft enough to forget you&#x27;re wearing it at night.</p></div></li><li data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-[48px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-7"><span class="eyebrow pt-1 text-signal-deep">03</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Domed sapphire window</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">A sapphire lens presses the optical array gently into the skin, keeping the signal clean through every stride and rep.</p></div></li><li data-reveal="true" class="grid grid-cols-[48px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-7"><span class="eyebrow pt-1 text-signal-deep">04</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">MagLock clasp</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Two titanium halves meet with 40 newtons of magnetic hold. On and off with one hand, secure through a sprint finish.</p></div></li></ol><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="relative aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] bg-surface"><img alt="Extreme close-up of the black twill weave with a signal-orange edge thread" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 20vw, 50vw" /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 128w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 256w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-weave.jpg"/></div><div class="relative aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] bg-surface"><img alt="The two titanium halves of the MagLock clasp meeting in a fine seam" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 20vw, 50vw" /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 128w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 256w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg"/></div></div></div></div></section>
